OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785750496
OL,3,CTwo arrested after man shot dead at
OL,4,CTraveller site in Wiltshire
OL,6,FA murder investigation is underway
OL,7,Fafter a man in his 30s was shot dead
OL,8,Fat a Traveller site in Wiltshire this
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FPolice were called to the site in
OL,12,FCalcutt, near Cricklade, at around
OL,13,F8.15am when South Western Ambulance
OL,14,FService alerted them a man had been
OL,15,Fshot.
OL,17,FThe victim, who is yet to be named
OL,18,Fpublicly, was declared dead at the
OL,19,Fscene and his next of kin have been
OL,20,Finformed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
