OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785750496
OL,3,CTwo arrested after man shot dead at
OL,4,CTraveller site in Wiltshire
OL,6,FA man in his 70s and a woman in her
OL,7,F40s have been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fpossession of a firearm and assisting
OL,9,Fan offender and have been taken into
OL,10,Fcustody for questioning.
OL,12,FA cordon is in place at the scene and
OL,13,Fa significant policing presence will
OL,14,Fremain in the area while an
OL,15,Finvestigation is carried out,
OL,16,FWiltshire Police said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
