PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785750496
OL,3,CTwo arrested after man shot dead at
OL,4,CTraveller site in Wiltshire
OL,6,FDetective Chief Inspector Phil Walker
OL,7,Fsaid: "This is an incredibly serious
OL,8,Fincident, and my thoughts are with the
OL,9,Fvictim's friends and family at this
OL,10,Fdevastating time.
OL,12,F"Enquiries are ongoing at the site and
OL,13,Fin the wider area to establish the
OL,14,Fcircumstances which have led to this
OL,15,Fincident and locate all the people
OL,16,Finvolved.
OL,18,F"A cordon is in place at the site and
OL,19,Fthe road leading to it has been closed
OL,20,Fto allow for enquiries to be conducted
OL,21,Fand I would ask that this is respected.
OL,26,@oD@GOUtD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
