PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785750496
OL,3,CTwo arrested after man shot dead at
OL,4,CTraveller site in Wiltshire
OL,6,F"Those in the area will see an
OL,7,Fincreased policing presence throughout
OL,8,Fthe evening as enquiries continue. We
OL,9,Fare really keen to hear from anybody
OL,10,Fwho has any information or witnessed
OL,11,Fanything suspicious this morning.
OL,13,F"If you can help, please contact us on
OL,14,F101 quoting log 95 of today's date."
OL,16,FAlternatively, information can be
OL,17,Fshared anonymously with Crimestoppers
OL,18,Fon 0800 555111.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUvD@dO]
